      "about": "I am a QA Lead with over 15 years of experience helping organizations deliver high-quality software across healthcare, fintech, government, retail and digital transformation programs.Throughout my career, I have led end-to-end testing activities including test strategy, manual testing, API testing, UAT, regression testing, system integration testing (SIT), release readiness and stakeholder management. I have worked as both the sole QA within Agile teams and as a Test Lead managing distributed QA resources across multiple projects.My technical experience includes Jira, Azure DevOps, SQL, Postman, AEM, WordPress, Confluence, Xray, Charles Proxy, Automation and Agile delivery practices. I am passionate about building collaborative relationships with developers, business analysts, product owners and project managers to ensure quality is embedded throughout the software development lifecycle.",
